      tools/fetch-native-deps.sh copies the pinned SDL 2.32.10 Android Java
      glue into src/main/java/org/libsdl. It is third-party upstream code and
      includes optional HID/Bluetooth paths which are not used by this port.
      Keep lint strict for the app itself while excluding only that copied tree.
    -->
    <issue id="all">
        <ignore path="src/main/java/org/libsdl/**" />
    </issue>
</lint>
